 multiplication:\n\n$$\n{Y}_{2\\times 3}{\\times }_{\\ne }{X}_{2\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $3$ columns in $Y$ and $3$ rows in $Z.$ Since the number of columns in $Y$ equals the number of rows in $Z,$ the matrices $Y$ and $Z$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{Y}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\times }_{✓}{Z}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 3}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statements I and III are true, while statement II is false." 13194139534230 true] [17592186282863 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282864 13194139534230 true] [17592186282863 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282865 13194139534230 true] [17592186282863 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282866 13194139534230 true] [17592186282863 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282867 13194139534230 true] [17592186282863 1000 #edb/ref 17592186282868 13194139534230 true] [17592186282863 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534230 true] [17592186282863 1041 "selection" 13194139534230 true] [17592186282863 1104 #edb/ref 17592186282865 13194139534230 true] [17592186282863 1110 #uuid "9cb8aeed-8720-58a3-9c27-db68e0ee00ab" 13194139534230 true] [17592186282864 1034 "II and III only" 13194139534230 true] [17592186282864 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534230 true] [17592186282864 1111 #uuid "2aca32e8-7d3e-55d5-ab41-6bf0d2e7c610" 13194139534230 true] [17592186282865 1034 "I and III only" 13194139534230 true] [17592186282865 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534230 true] [17592186282865 1111 #uuid "af0065fd-2614-5443-9593-e5c739f69ec4" 13194139534230 true] [17592186282866 1034 "I only" 13194139534230 true] [17592186282866 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534230 true] [17592186282866 1111 #uuid "fa040ef8-ac8b-5437-b44c-cc48674960fb" 13194139534230 true] [17592186282867 1034 "III only" 13194139534230 true] [17592186282867 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534230 true] [17592186282867 1111 #uuid "e003cc41-917b-5f03-bf99-0c9dd841a595" 13194139534230 true] [17592186282868 1034 "I and II only" 13194139534230 true] [17592